<title>UK: Rotork sells gas, refinery operations.</title>
<headline>Rotork sells gas, refinery operations.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British specialist engineering group Rotork Plc said on Friday it sold its gas and refinery operations.</p>
<p>Rotork said its gas business was sold for 640,000 pounds to Signal Instrument Company Ltd and the oil refinery business for 750,000 pounds to Sysco Analytics Ltd.</p>
<p>Rotork said the buyers would issue loan notes totalling 1.26 million pounds to Rotork under which staged payments will be made until January 2002. It said the balance was paid in cash on Friday.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
